"Auto uses Jazz for jazz, New Orleans and blues; World percussion for Latin, Afro-Cuban, Afrobeat, Highlife and Middle Eastern; House/Techno for house and techno styles; 808 for the other electronic genres; Rock for rock and punk; Brush for soul, reggae, gospel, country, lo-fi, trip hop and pop; Acoustic for all other genres. You can choose any kit manually." = "Auto uses Jazz for jazz, New Orleans and blues; World percussion for Latin, Afro-Cuban, Afrobeat, Highlife and Middle Eastern; House/Techno for house and techno styles; 808 for the other electronic genres; Rock for rock and punk; Brush for soul, reggae, gospel, country, lo-fi, trip hop and pop; Acoustic for all other genres. You can choose any kit manually.";
